      "writtenOn": "2024-06-27T17:35:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think so too. I put the conditional here so that we do not add an accidental double `/` here in Soong if the pattern in `SYSTEM_OTHER_ODEX_FILTER` is refactored to begin with `/`",
